"backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g092"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 838145800, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1028162214, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e093", "type": "text", "x": 54, "y": 1063, "width": 415.8, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g092"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1720926263, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 973838694, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "An example run — pressed at 16:06, bulletin in Turkish", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "An example run — pressed at 16:06, bulletin in Turkish", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e094", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 1094, "width": 850.5, "height": 78.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 858641202, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2116481899, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "collect     16 feeds polled       1214 items seen  ->  31 new     one feed 404s; five in a row and that source disables itself\ndedupe      31 candidates         ->  24                          \"OpenAI ships GPT-5.6 Luna\" = \"GPT-5.6 Luna is here\": 3 URLs, 1 story\nenrich      24 examined           ->  22 with a body              18 from the feed's own HTML, 3 fetched, 1 Tavily credit\nsummarize   24 branches, 10 at a time ->  24 summaries            headline, three sentences, why it matters, tags, importance 1-5\nrank        24 summaries          ->  the day in order + a note   if that one call fails: importance first, source weight second\npersist     1 run, 6 run_steps, 24 summaries                      about $0.03 — a month of pressing this is $2-3", "fontSize": 10.5, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "collect     16 feeds polled       1214 items seen  ->  31 new     one feed 404s; five in a row and that source disables itself\ndedupe      31 candidates         ->  24                          \"OpenAI ships GPT-5.6 Luna\" = \"GPT-5.6 Luna is here\": 3 URLs, 1 story\nenrich      24 examined           ->  22 with a body              18 from the feed's own HTML, 3 fetched, 1 Tavily credit\nsummarize   24 branches, 10 at a time ->  24 summaries            headline, three sentences, why it matters, tags, importance 1-5\nrank        24 summaries          ->  the day in order + a note   if that one call fails: importance first, source weight second\npersist     1 run, 6 run_steps, 24 summaries                      about $0.03 — a month of pressing this is $2-3", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e095", "type": "text", "x": 56, "y": 1196, "width": 613.5, "height": 43.1, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1527129487, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 124468791, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Then you open /, read it, and mark one summary wrong; that verdict goes to the verdicts table.\n/runs/<id> shows those six lines again with their tokens, their cost and how long each one took.\nNothing above happens on its own: the clock only polls feeds, and the bulletin waits for a press.", "fontSize": 11.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Then you open /, read it, and mark one summary wrong; that verdict goes to the verdicts table.\n/runs/<id> shows those six lines again with their tokens, their cost and how long each one took.\nNothing above happens on its own: the clock only polls feeds, and the bulletin waits for a press.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e096", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1240, "y": 1052, "width": 260, "height": 228, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g096"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 119988829, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1200093500, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e097", "type": "text", "x": 1254, "y": 1063, "width": 161.7, "height": 17.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g096"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2028255630, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1113145427, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "evals — a fifth layer", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "evals — a fifth layer", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e098", "type": "text", "x": 1254, "y": 1085.5, "width": 196.4, "height": 157.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["g096"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 831698693, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1478675320, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "src/ainews/evals/ is imported by\nneither the pipeline nor the web\nlayer. Only the CLI reaches it, so\nthe app still has exactly one\nbutton that spends money.\n\n-  pytest, offline, over a\n   recorded fixture\n-  the reader's right / wrong\n-  a sampled grounding judge\n-  rank stability: Kendall tau,\n   0.47 and 0.50 so far", "fontSize": 10.5, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "src/ainews/evals/ is imported by\nneither the pipeline nor the web\nlayer. Only the CLI reaches it, so\nthe app still has exactly one\nbutton that spends money.\n\n-  pytest, offline, over a\n   recorded fixture\n-  the reader's right / wrong\n-  a sampled grounding judge\n-  rank stability: Kendall tau,\n   0.47 and 0.50 so far", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e099", "type": "text", "x": 1256, "y": 1250, "width": 99.0, "height": 13.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1920828234, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1501175504, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "ainews eval run", "fontSize": 11, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "ainews eval run", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}
